[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315186341","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110426#issuecomment-3315186341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110426","id":3315186341,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fmbql","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T19:20:36Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T19:20:36Z","body":"This bisects to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106217, which appears to add auto-bolding to custom editor fonts, so this seems intentional but I'll ping @DeeJayLSP to confirm.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315186341/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315258460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110426#issuecomment-3315258460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110426","id":3315258460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FmtRc","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T21:08:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T21:20:38Z","body":"Weird, no blurrying happens on my side by testing the exact same font download.\n\nAnd comparing the screenshot above, I can notice it's blurry even in the before case. Are we sure my PR is the culprit?\n\nScreenshot above/InterVariable on my side (4.4.1)\n\n<img width=\"365\" height=\"264\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c307b8d8-0e57-424b-909c-d4611b16d1b4\" />\n\nNote that I use a completely different system.\n\nThe same download has non-variable versions. does blur persist if you use them?\n\n> This bisects to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106217, which appears to add auto-bolding to custom editor fonts, so this seems intentional\n\nYes, it is intentional. If we're using a variable font in a Bold font setting, we're almost sure we want it to show in a bold weight.\n\nWhat isn't intentional is the font getting blurry, which per my screenshot above seems to happen even without my PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315258460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315270003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110426#issuecomment-3315270003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110426","id":3315270003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FmwFz","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T21:21:21Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T21:22:36Z","body":"> Weird, no blurrying happens on my side by testing the exact same font download.\n\nIt looks much better / is fixed when I set the same font to the bold one.\n\n<img width=\"673\" height=\"58\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/957e19c7-5687-473d-99ba-5ae0205fdc46\" />\n\nBefore / After\n\n<img width=\"374\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/187b27a0-283e-4b49-b3c1-da85d1937258\" />\n<img width=\"374\" height=\"172\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de1ce666-ad92-4aae-ac5e-d42d4a5c3d9e\" />\n\n\n> And comparing the screenshot above, I can notice it's blurry even in the before case. Are we sure my PR is the culprit?\n\nYou are right, it looks a little bit blurry as well.\nI'm confused as well now. Maybe he tries to make the `InterVariable` font bold, but only when the `Main Font Bold` is not set? I'm not sure.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315270003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315275333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110426#issuecomment-3315275333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110426","id":3315275333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FmxZF","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T21:32:52Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T21:34:16Z","body":"I get what happens now.\n\nIf Main Font is set, but not Main Font Bold, the engine tries to take Main Font and \"embolden\" it by a factor of 0.6.\n\nThis is from #59127. I think we may dismiss this as a regression.\n\nThe \"fix\" for this would be checking if the provided Main Font is variable, and make it use a weight of 700 instead of this embolden procedure.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315275333/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315282552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110426#issuecomment-3315282552","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110426","id":3315282552,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FmzJ4","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T21:50:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T21:50:59Z","body":"> If Main Font is set, but not Main Font Bold, the engine tries to take Main Font and \"embolden\" it by a factor of 0.6.\n\nNice catch!\n\n> I think we may dismiss this as a regression.\n\nAgree. The only thing that makes it seem worthwhile to investigate further is the slight blurring. But this does not look like a regression still.\n\n> The \"fix\" for this would be checking if the provided Main Font is variable, and make it use a weight of 700 instead of this embolden procedure.\n\nThat makes sense!\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315282552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315302983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110426#issuecomment-3315302983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110426","id":3315302983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fm4JH","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T22:39:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T22:44:46Z","body":"As I was writing the fix, turns out there was in fact a regression (the weight being set to bold and the embolden process happen at the same time when only one of them should).\n\nI wasn't aware there was an embolding process there already. The fix makes them coexist nicely.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315302983/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]